e with crew members. If any agent can confirm that A manages stress well and communicates effectively, my confidence in A would increase; conversely, evidence of poor stress tolerance or severe communication issues would shift my preference toward another candidate.\n**What would change my vote:** Positive, explicit information about A\u2019s stress resilience and crew communication would solidify his lead; strong evidence that another candidate (e.g., B\u2019s stress handling combined with acceptable teamwork) outweighs A\u2019s negatives would cause me to reconsider.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_2\", \"vote\": \"Candidate A\"}"}
